    "body": "The ES spec change has landed! I've rebased and made some minor editorial tweaks in light of that.\r\n\r\nGiven that this has received significant review from @nyaxt and @hiroshige-g in the course of implementing it in Chrome, I will now merge this. It's not necessarily perfect yet; we have a few remaining cases we're unsure of around error handling behavior, and we think that the spec might be written using a slow algorithm that, which we could clean up so that implementers have to do less non-obvious optimizations. But this change represents a significant improvement from the status quo, and serves as a good foundation going forward.",
